  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Currently when browsing friend locations it shows the number of friends in a world but not the number of users total in the world. This makes it difficult to judge if it's worth joining a world when your computer (or you as an individual) cannot handle large instances or have similar issues with potential numbers of people present (such as some worlds with a low user limit, or even knowing it's only the one or two people there).  It would be great to be able to check that at a glance.",
